{"skill":{"slug":"deepwiki","displayName":"DeepWiki"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768156757977,"changelog":"Initial release of DeepWiki skill.\n\n- Query the DeepWiki MCP server for documentation related to public GitHub repositories.\n- Search and retrieve repository wiki structures and specific documentation topics.\n- Ask complex, AI-powered questions about repository documentation.\n- No authentication needed; works with any public GitHub repository.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1304,"sha256":"87d079fd9c4a4bd4581f9f7761b9521b10da4cd893a0b22a837a6f03ce72f226","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/deepwiki.js","size":3452,"sha256":"18aee41aab66dae79199a4e3a73846ff7353636e27fd23279751a30c0d545cd9","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1646,"sha256":"0ee43e73882d8dbf78c191e74f8eb185101d13e2f43be32e7ffa8c7c374fbe54","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789015503267,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"4fde49d474ba0d4b1f5de0cae0c9291cee656c6114d7cd5a2ca10c41d99a7509","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/4fde49d474ba0d4b1f5de0cae0c9291cee656c6114d7cd5a2ca10c41d99a7509","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: deepwiki\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to query the DeepWiki MCP server for GitHub repository documentation. The `SKILL.md` file clearly describes its purpose and commands without any prompt injection attempts. The `scripts/deepwiki.js` script makes HTTPS requests exclusively to `mcp.deepwiki.com`, as stated in the documentation. It does not access local files, environment variables, or execute arbitrary shell commands, and there is no evidence of data exfiltration, persistence, or obfuscation. All network activity is confined to the stated purpose and domain.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159706305},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":11,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789015503267},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill does what it says: it sends user-requested public GitHub repository questions to DeepWiki and prints the response.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to mcp.deepwiki.com is proportionate to the skill's documented DeepWiki integration, and there is no evidence of local file collection, credential use, or broad environment access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains a markdown skill file and one local Node.js script with no package install steps or external dependencies.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill discloses the DeepWiki server and command usage, but users should understand that repository names, questions, and wiki paths are sent to DeepWiki when invoked.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The script does not install persistence, modify tools, write memory, request privileges, or store credentials.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is querying DeepWiki for public GitHub repository documentation, and the shipped script only implements ask, structure, and contents calls for that service.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you are comfortable sending the repository name and any question or wiki path you type to DeepWiki. Avoid entering private repository details or sensitive internal information unless you intend to share it with that service.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The script posts the user-provided repository and question/path to DeepWiki, which is expected for a DeepWiki query tool; the skill notes the external base server, so this is guidance-worthy but not a Review-level concern.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789015503267}}}}}